// The TS deterministic-simulation runner (spec/design/simulation-testing.md), a function-by-function
// port of the Go reference (impl/go/sim_runner_test.go). It executes `.sim` traces generated by
// scripts/sim_gen.rb against a Database over the simulated disk (disk.ts), checks the oracles of
// §8, and writes a transcript the driver (scripts/sim.rb) compares across cores byte for byte.

